ု ဣ​သ​ရေ​လ၊ယ​ခု​မှ​အ​စ​ပြု​၍","poem":1},{"text":"ကာ​လ​အ​စဉ်​အ​ဆက်​ထာ​ဝ​ရ​ဘု​ရား​ကို ကိုး​စား​လော့။","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/mya_ojv/PSA/131.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/mya_ojv/PSA/132.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/mya_ojv/PSA/130.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":3}